"Continuously monitors your source sites — reachability and real-site "
"verification, the same check used in the DNS diagnostics. When enabled, "
"an \"UpTime\" entry appears in the sidebar with an Uptime-Kuma-style "
"dashboard (online/offline, uptime percentage, response time, heartbeat "
"history)."
