msgstr "✓ Gespeichert — Neustart erforderlich"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1518
msgid ""
"External REST API for Home Assistant & Co. Auth via X-Api-Key header or "
"?apikey=."
msgstr ""
"Externe REST-API für Home Assistant & Co. Auth per X-Api-Key Header oder "
"?apikey=."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1525
msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "Wird geladen…"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1527
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Anzeigen"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1529
msgid "Regenerate"
msgstr "Neu generieren"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1535
msgid "Base URL"
msgstr "Basis-URL"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1539
msgid "Machine-readable description"
msgstr "Maschinenlesbare Beschreibung"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1541
msgid ""
"The OpenAPI document describes every endpoint, its parameters and the "
"scope it needs. It is generated from the routes that are actually "
"running, so it cannot drift from the code, and it is readable without a "
"key — a client cannot know which scopes to ask for until it can read the "
"spec."
msgstr ""
"Das OpenAPI-Dokument beschreibt jeden Endpunkt, seine Parameter und den "
"benötigten Scope. Es wird aus den tatsächlich laufenden Routen erzeugt "
"und kann daher nicht vom Code abweichen — und es ist ohne Schlüssel "
"lesbar, denn ein Client kann nicht wissen, welche Scopes er anfragen "
"muss, bevor er die Spezifikation lesen kann."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1548
msgid "Scoped API keys"
msgstr "API-Schlüssel mit Scopes"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1550
msgid ""
"The single key above is all-or-nothing: whatever can read the status can "
"also read your whole library and history. A scoped key carries only the "
"scopes you pick, can be revoked or expired on its own, and is stored "
"hashed — so it is shown exactly once, when you create it, and cannot be "
"recovered afterwards. The single key keeps working and grants every "
"scope."
msgstr ""
"Der einzelne Schlüssel oben ist alles-oder-nichts: Was den Status lesen "
"kann, liest auch die ganze Bibliothek und den Verlauf. Ein Schlüssel mit "
"Scopes trägt nur, was du auswählst, lässt sich einzeln widerrufen oder "
"befristen und wird gehasht gespeichert — er wird also genau einmal "
"angezeigt, beim Anlegen, und ist danach nicht wiederherstellbar. Der "
"einzelne Schlüssel funktioniert weiter und gewährt alle Scopes."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1556
#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:2137
msgid "New API key"
msgstr "Neuer API-Schlüssel"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1559
msgid "Endpoints"
msgstr "Endpunkte"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1565
msgid "Status & queue overview"
msgstr "Status & Queue-Übersicht"

