msgstr "Stabil"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1765
msgid ""
"Switch between the stable release and the development channel (latest "
"commits from the models branch — may be unstable). Switching installs the"
" selected version right away."
msgstr ""
"Wechsle zwischen der stabilen Version und dem Entwicklungs-Kanal (neueste"
" Commits aus dem models-Branch — kann instabil sein). Beim Wechsel wird "
"die gewählte Version sofort installiert."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1771
msgid "Development channel"
msgstr "Entwicklungskanal"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1773
msgid ""
"You are using a stable release. The development channel contains the "
"latest commits directly from the models branch — it may be unstable or "
"contain unfinished features."
msgstr ""
"Du verwendest ein stabiles Release. Der Entwicklungskanal enthält die "
"neuesten Commits direkt aus dem models-Branch — er kann instabil sein "
"oder unfertige Features enthalten."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1784
msgid "Automatic updates"
msgstr "Automatische Updates"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1788
msgid "Install available updates automatically"
msgstr "Verfügbare Updates automatisch installieren"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1797
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Uhrzeit"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1802
msgid ""
"When enabled, an available update is installed automatically at the "
"selected time on the chosen weekdays. The app restarts itself and running"
" downloads resume afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, wird ein verfügbares Update automatisch zur gewählten "
"Uhrzeit an den gewählten Wochentagen installiert. Die App startet sich "
"selbst neu, laufende Downloads werden danach fortgesetzt."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1820
#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1842
msgid "Create backup"
msgstr "Backup erstellen"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1822
msgid ""
"Export your settings and data to a single backup file. Choose which "
"categories to include. A password is required — it encrypts sensitive "
"values such as API keys and passwords. Without the password the backup "
"cannot be restored."
msgstr ""
"Exportiere deine Einstellungen und Daten in eine einzige Backup-Datei. "
"Wähle, welche Kategorien enthalten sein sollen. Ein Passwort ist "
"erforderlich — es verschlüsselt sensible Werte wie API-Schlüssel und "
"Passwörter. Ohne das Passwort kann das Backup nicht wiederhergestellt "
"werden."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1829
msgid "Save backup without a password (insecure)"
msgstr "Backup ohne Passwort sichern (unsicher)"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1833
#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1863
msgid "Backup password"
msgstr "Backup-Passwort"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1837
msgid "Repeat password"
msgstr "Passwort wiederholen"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1849
msgid "Restore backup"
msgstr "Backup wiederherstellen"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1851
msgid ""
"Restore a backup file. Select the file and enter its password to preview "
"the contents, then choose which categories to restore."
msgstr ""
"Stelle eine Backup-Datei wieder her. Wähle die Datei und gib ihr Passwort"
" ein, um den Inhalt in der Vorschau zu sehen, und wähle dann die "
"wiederherzustellenden Kategorien."

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1855
msgid "Backup file"
msgstr "Backup-Datei"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1856
msgid "Choose backup file"
msgstr "Backup-Datei wählen"

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:1858
